{"ch": 86, "verses": [{"n": 1, "ar": "بِسۡمِ اللّٰہِ الرَّحۡمٰنِ الرَّحِیۡمِ ﴿۱﴾", "en": "In the name of Allah, the Gracious, the Merciful.", "w": ["in the name of", "Allah", "the Gracious", "the Merciful", ""]}, {"n": 2, "ar": "وَالسَّمَآءِ وَالطَّارِقِ ۙ﴿۲﴾", "en": "By the heaven and the Morning Star —", "w": ["by the heaven", "and the Morning Star", ""]}, {"n": 3, "ar": "وَمَاۤ اَدۡرٰٮکَ مَا الطَّارِقُ ۙ﴿۳﴾", "en": "And what should make thee know what the Morning Star is?", "w": ["and what", "should make thee know", "what", "the Morning Star is", ""]}, {"n": 4, "ar": "النَّجۡمُ الثَّاقِبُ ۙ﴿۴﴾", "en": "<i>It is</i> the star of piercing brightness —", "w": ["<i>it is</i> the star", "of piercing brightness", ""]}, {"n": 5, "ar": "اِنۡ کُلُّ نَفۡسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَیۡہَا حَافِظٌ ؕ﴿۵﴾", "en": "There is no soul but has a guardian over it.", "w": ["not", "(is) every", "soul", "but", "over it", "has a guardian", ""]}, {"n": 6, "ar": "فَلۡیَنۡظُرِ الۡاِنۡسَانُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ ؕ﴿۶﴾", "en": "So let man consider from what he is created.", "w": ["so let consider", "man", "from what", "he is created", ""]}, {"n": 7, "ar": "خُلِقَ مِنۡ مَّآءٍ دَافِقٍ ۙ﴿۷﴾", "en": "He is created from a gushing fluid,", "w": ["He is created", "from", "a fluid", "gushing", ""]}, {"n": 8, "ar": "یَّخۡرُجُ مِنۡۢ بَیۡنِ الصُّلۡبِ وَالتَّرَآئِبِ ؕ﴿۸﴾", "en": "Which issues forth from between the loins and the breast-bones.", "w": ["which issues forth", "from", "between", "the loins", "and the breast-bones", ""]}, {"n": 9, "ar": "اِنَّہٗ عَلٰی رَجۡعِہٖ لَقَادِرٌ ؕ﴿۹﴾", "en": "Surely, He has the power to bring him back <i>to life</i>", "w": ["surely, He", "to", "bring him back <i>to life</i>", "has the power", ""]}, {"n": 10, "ar": "یَوۡمَ تُبۡلَی السَّرَآئِرُ ۙ﴿۱۰﴾", "en": "<i>On</i> the day when secrets shall be disclosed.", "w": ["<i>on</i> the day", "shall be disclosed", "when secrets", ""]}, {"n": 11, "ar": "فَمَا لَہٗ مِنۡ قُوَّۃٍ وَّلَا نَاصِرٍ ﴿ؕ۱۱﴾", "en": "Then he will have no strength and no helper.", "w": ["then no", "he will have", "any", "strength", "and no", "helper", ""]}, {"n": 12, "ar": "وَالسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ الرَّجۡعِ ﴿ۙ۱۲﴾", "en": "[✲]By the cloud which gives rain after rain,", "w": ["by the cloud", "which", "gives rain after rain", ""]}, {"n": 13, "ar": "وَالۡاَرۡضِ ذَاتِ الصَّدۡعِ ﴿ۙ۱۳﴾", "en": "And <i>by</i> the earth which opens out <i>with herbage</i>,", "w": ["and <i>by</i> the earth", "which", "opens out <i>with herbage</i>", ""]}, {"n": 14, "ar": "اِنَّہٗ لَقَوۡلٌ فَصۡلٌ ﴿ۙ۱۴﴾", "en": "It is surely a decisive word,", "w": ["it is surely", "word", "a decisive", ""]}, {"n": 15, "ar": "وَّمَا ہُوَ بِالۡہَزۡلِ ﴿ؕ۱۵﴾", "en": "And it is not a useless talk.", "w": ["and not", "it is", "useless talk", ""]}, {"n": 16, "ar": "اِنَّہُمۡ یَکِیۡدُوۡنَ کَیۡدًا ﴿ۙ۱۶﴾", "en": "[✲]Surely they plan a plan,", "w": ["surely they", "plan", "a plan", ""]}, {"n": 17, "ar": "وَّاَکِیۡدُ کَیۡدًا ﴿ۚۖ۱۷﴾", "en": "[✲]And I <i>also</i> plan a plan.", "w": ["and I <i>also</i> plan", "a plan", ""]}, {"n": 18, "ar": "فَمَہِّلِ الۡکٰفِرِیۡنَ اَمۡہِلۡہُمۡ رُوَیۡدًا ﴿٪۱۸﴾", "en": "So give time to the disbelievers. <i>Aye</i>, give them time for a little while.", "w": ["so give time", "to the disbelievers", "<i>aye</i>, give them time", "for a little while", ""]}]}